{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Skeleton Monk, a skillful martial artist and powerful Elemental mage. After a betrayal led to your death and the capture of your lover, you find yourself reawakened from the grave months later. With no leads and a burning desire for revenge, you set out to discover the fate of your lover and hunt down your killer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dark, Eastern Fantasy World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Mortis, a land of imbalance ruled by the tyrannical Baron. Use your prowess to bring balance to the land and usurp the throne of it's strangling ruler.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Impactful Martial Arts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your hand-to-hand combat skills and Elemental powers to engage in a unique blend of melee and magic combat. Master a dodge-focused combat system and retaliate with burning precision</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Life?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover your skeletal nature and the fate of your captured lover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2890660?t=1772357321","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772357321","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/d4bd1636157ac42b5de68d54e351f3dd66bdf9b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772357321","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/d4bd1636157ac42b5de68d54e351f3dd66bdf9b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772357321","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragrap